/-- **Entry excludes each of the 12 blocks.** For each trap of `farWalls`, if every finitely supported right half
driven by its block enters it, the center column does not eventually repeat the block. -/
theorem far_absorption_excludes (C : WTrap) (hC : C ∈ farWalls) (hA : C.Absorption) :
    ¬ Rule30StripCertificates.EventuallyWord C.b :=
  absorption_excludes C (List.all_eq_true.mp farWalls_check C hC) hA

